This product is a C# port of the inference code of Stanza
(https://github.com/stanfordnlp/stanza), licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

  Copyright 2019 The Board of Trustees of The Leland Stanford Junior University

The tokenizer, multi-word token expander, part-of-speech tagger, constituency parser
and shared layers were translated from Stanza's Python source to C# and TorchSharp,
keeping their behavior.

Stanza's pretrained models are not included. They are distributed by the Stanza
project under licenses that vary with their training data.
